# Build context for ./backend builds (compose + CI: context ./backend).
# Mirrors the root .dockerignore for this context — the root file only
# covers root-context builds (worker/Dockerfile), so secrets, caches and
# local artifacts need their own door here. The image only gets what the
# Dockerfile COPYs: pyproject.toml and studyspace/.
.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.git
.github
